: false, "body": "hello! I saw the appeal to draw my character.\nMain features are her red eyes and purple hair\n\nWould like to see her in a suit if possible, pose will be up to you\nThanks ^^\n\nhttps://imgur.com/a/rr5krsa", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@illust_aka_/works/7", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/331e046a/uploads/origins/21281a0d-a59f-40a2-a902-701dcb3c3eaf?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=34a477166dbd87132015c0f3140e1352", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/331e046a/uploads/origins/21281a0d-a59f-40a2-a902-701dcb3c3eaf?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=34a477166dbd87132015c0f3140e1352, https://si.imgix.net/331e046a/uploads/origins/21281a0d-a59f-40a2-a902-701dcb3c3eaf?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=ac7f61ba4288b2cdcea4aa019f2c96b9 2x, https://si.imgix.net/331e046a/uploads/origins/21281a0d-a59f-40a2-a902-701dcb3c3eaf?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=0ff23de442f42aed3169f6c0e8a87cfd 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "Thanks for your appeal\nI would love for you to draw my OC(Neza)\nI've been thinking about a certain pose I want her in and hope will able to do that for me.\nThe throne doesn't have to be the same, so do your thing with that.\nHowever it would be amazing if the facial expression and actual pose/positioning can be somewhat the same. \nI don't have a weapon design for her, so you can just ignore the weapon in the pose reference.\n\nI may also use this for a background/scene on twitch/youtube in the future.\n\nPose Reference:\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1qyQJEIwabrqiHyvM-NoWiADGZEp7w6bK?usp=sharing\n\nNeza Reference:\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1uuh_DvQPsNL5y-jNt0_Znjh1t0qri0zd?usp=sharing", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@illust_aka_/works/6", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/6eec3118/uploads/origins/9572dc4a-8d8f-4c54-ab70-caab203bc901?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=986e2336315f6ec672891d14011e7f94", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/6eec3118/uploads/origins/9572dc4a-8d8f-4c54-ab70-caab203bc901?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=986e2336315f6ec672891d14011e7f94, https://si.imgix.net/6eec3118/uploads/origins/9572dc4a-8d8f-4c54-ab70-caab203bc901?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=0a9a5e79031cf800c120e05dcc70f083 2x, https://si.imgix.net/6eec3118/uploads/origins/9572dc4a-8d8f-4c54-ab70-caab203bc901?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=93a5911f500b580df7d9faf698bbd222 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "Hello,\n\nthanks for appealing to me. \nPlease make a drawing for my OC. \nReferences are here: http://tempest.moe\n\nMy OC is designed with silver hair and red eye. \nIt shall wear cloth for a magical girl and has a witch's book in the hand. \nThe rest is up to you. \n\nThank you. \nRimuro", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@illust_aka_/works/5", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/4bd2de8b/uploads/origins/d5c82201-700c-47d3-b68b-b1a32d64c6bb?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=d7c5437e8f4169ff0588b6f1275b4fe1", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/4bd2de8b/uploads/origins/d5c82201-700c-47d3-b68b-b1a32d64c6bb?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=d7c5437e8f4169ff0588b6f1275b4fe1, https://si.imgix.net/4bd2de8b/uploads/origins/d5c82201-700c-47d3-b68b-b1a32d64c6bb?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=36117c946480d49c1ade7ccd6bd617dd 2x, https://si.imgix.net/4bd2de8b/uploads/origins/d5c82201-700c-47d3-b68b-b1a32d64c6bb?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=6dec7011b20cccb9d6fb9a1cae599dc6 3x", 